Package: phenoshot
Title: AI-Based Plant Image Analysis for Morphological Trait Measurement
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("JK", "Kim", , "kimjk@agronomy4future.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9913-8768"))
Description: Provides an automated pipeline for plant phenotyping through image 
    analysis. Uses AI-based background removal (remove.bg API or U2Net) combined 
    with OpenCV-based object detection to measure morphological traits including 
    area, perimeter, length, and width of plant objects. Supports JPG, PNG, and 
    HEIC image formats. Designed for agronomic research applications such as 
    leaf area estimation, fruit morphology analysis, and seedling measurement.
